<title>SWEDEN: Skanska Q1 profit after fin items falls 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Skanska Q1 profit after fin items falls 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company Skanska on Monday reported these earnings for the three months ending March 31, 1996,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after deprec	   594 vs    781</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		    412 vs    537</p>
<p> Order bookings			   14,814 vs 10,088</p>
<p> Sales					10,643 vs  9,835</p>
<p> Operating costs			  10,236 vs  9,418</p>
<p> Capital gain				   43 vs    141</p>
<p> Net interest items			  251 vs    231</p>
<p> Other financial items	     CREDIT 69 vs     13 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					     110 vs     85</p>
<p> Minorities				     19 vs     61</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
